KVarN V2-runner port: lets SPEC=dflash2 run with CTX=huge (KVarN KV +
prefix caching). Depends on hunks from the patches/ set and from
kvarn-0.27.1.patch, hence applied last. Every hunk carries a
port(kvarn-v2) marker; the install script verifies marker counts per
file and fails the build loudly when a hunk does not land.

Changes vs the 0.27.1-era cut, re-cut against 6a9c69fa8513:
- model_runner.py Bug-B guard DROPPED: native gather_batch_req_state now
  threads has_prefill into get_uniform_decode_token_count.
- speculator.py zeros-guard hunk DROPPED: native _cached_candidate_ids
  already zeros-initialized.
